{
 "duration": 26.675,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Jake took his dog Rocky on an eight-mile hike.",
   "start": 0.5,
   "end": 2.934
  },
  {
   "text": "Rocky's longest walk before that was two miles.",
   "start": 3.334,
   "end": 5.917
  },
  {
   "text": "At mile five, Rocky lay down and wouldn't move.",
   "start": 6.317,
   "end": 9.029
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. Ask your vet first, then build up slowly, adding a little distance each week.",
   "start": 9.579,
   "end": 14.967
  },
  {
   "text": "Carry water just for your dog, and check paws at every break.",
   "start": 15.367,
   "end": 18.794
  },
  {
   "text": "Turn back early if your dog lags or pants hard.",
   "start": 19.194,
   "end": 21.839
  },
  {
   "text": "A month later, they finished together.",
   "start": 22.389,
   "end": 24.091
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next dog hike.",
   "start": 24.641,
   "end": 26.475
  }
 ],
